lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.lembas.goal=Eat a wrapped Lembas.
## Context: One-sentence goal of the deed lesson "fireflies", shown under the lesson text after "Your task:" and on the task screen. It names exactly what the player must do.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.fireflies.goal=Catch a firefly with a glass bottle.
## Context: One-sentence goal of the deed lesson "rope", shown under the lesson text after "Your task:" and on the task screen. It names exactly what the player must do.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.rope.goal=Hang an elven rope.
## Context: One-sentence goal of the deed lesson "gifts", shown under the lesson text after "Your task:" and on the task screen. It names exactly what the player must do.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.gifts.goal=Win the trust of a squirrel with a Mallorn acorn.
