lothlorien.message.lore.saplings.outside=§7This sapling stands outside the Golden Wood; it does not count.
## Context: The trader refuses a player whose Harmony is Shunned, including a player carrying a request. Peaceful conduct in the forest can restore access; no request form or trade screen opens.
lothlorien.message.trade.refused.shunned=§7The elf will not trade with you. Learn to live in peace with the forest, then return.
